{"5030570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Supermarket Organizer", "steam_appid": 5030570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030570/extras/8369379b1d189efd07802819c7aff6ec.poster.avif?t=1787904228\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030570/extras/8369379b1d189efd07802819c7aff6ec.webm?t=1787904228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030570/extras/8369379b1d189efd07802819c7aff6ec.mp4?t=1787904228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏪 Turn Empty Stores into Cozy Konbinis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An empty store is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry in furniture, arrange every shelf, and transform it into a warm, beautifully organized Japanese convenience store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📦 Unbox &amp; Organize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open boxes filled with snacks, drinks, magazines, desserts, and everyday essentials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the perfect place for every product and enjoy the simple satisfaction of neat, organized shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030570/extras/86d8f73ffbb8c01177ea0c6ab599810c.poster.avif?t=1787904228\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030570/extras/86d8f73ffbb8c01177ea0c6ab599810c.webm?t=1787904228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030570/extras/86d8f73ffbb8c01177ea0c6ab599810c.mp4?t=1787904228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍃Relax and Take Your Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no timers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just peaceful organizing, relaxing music, and cozy Japanese atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030570/extras/3872ffbdf0c77eb1a5cf1205a6ef1a6d.poster.avif?t=1787904228\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030570/extras/3872ffbdf0c77eb1a5cf1205a6ef1a6d.webm?t=1787904228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030570/extras/3872ffbdf0c77eb1a5cf1205a6ef1a6d.mp4?t=1787904228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⛩️ Discover Three Charming Konbinis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each store offers a fresh layout, new environment, and another cozy space waiting to be transformed into the perfect konbini.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030570/extras/8369379b1d189efd07802819c7aff6ec.poster.avif?t=1787904228\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030570/extras/8369379b1d189efd07802819c7aff6ec.webm?t=1787904228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030570/extras/8369379b1d189efd07802819c7aff6ec.mp4?t=1787904228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\